 "summary": {
  "ja": [
   "同じ約 260 × 290 m の範囲を、航空レーザー測量の点群（2023年3〜4月計測）と、PLATEAU の建物モデル（LOD2・空中写真のテクスチャつき）で示す。左下の切り替えで見比べられる。"
  ],
  "en": [
   "The same area of about 260 x 290 m as airborne LiDAR points (surveyed March-April 2023) and as PLATEAU building models (LOD2, textured from aerial photos). Switch between them."
  ]
 },
